WEBVTT

00:03.002 --> 00:04.796
It's time for you to die!

00:13.638 --> 00:14.723
Twisting.

00:14.973 --> 00:16.182
Wrapping.

00:18.643 --> 00:19.769
Whirpool.

00:20.270 --> 00:21.521
Current.

00:27.652 --> 00:29.237
My sword feels heavy.

00:30.864 --> 00:31.990
But...

00:32.657 --> 00:34.659
Second Form Modified.

00:35.952 --> 00:38.288
Lateral Water Wheel.

02:31.901 --> 02:33.069
I did it.

02:33.153 --> 02:35.989
Without water,
Whirlpool won't be as powerful.

02:36.489 --> 02:40.618
Thanks to his attacks, they increased
the power to wrap around the arrows.

02:43.246 --> 02:44.289
You bastard!

02:44.372 --> 02:45.957
You bastard!

02:46.040 --> 02:50.753
As long as I bring your head back,
I can get our lord's acceptance.

02:50.962 --> 02:55.216
I'll never forgive you!

02:55.550 --> 02:58.720
You let my face touch this dirty ground!

02:59.262 --> 03:01.723
You're going down with me!

03:04.559 --> 03:06.519
Damn it! I haven't won yet!

03:08.187 --> 03:11.691
Among the arrows I faced,
this one has the strongest traction.

03:12.066 --> 03:14.444
If I don't use multiple moves
consecutively to soften the blow,

03:14.527 --> 03:15.987
my body will shatter into pieces.

03:16.905 --> 03:17.989
Fourth Form.

03:18.072 --> 03:19.115
Striking Tide.

03:24.871 --> 03:26.706
I feel a weight on my body.

03:27.081 --> 03:28.666
I can't swing my sword.

03:29.083 --> 03:30.084
Move.

03:30.376 --> 03:31.669
I must make my move.

03:32.045 --> 03:34.923
I can't be defeated at this place.

03:35.590 --> 03:36.633
Second Form.

03:37.133 --> 03:38.343
Water Wheel.

03:44.015 --> 03:45.308
Waterfall Basin.

03:48.519 --> 03:49.646
Water Surface Slash.

03:50.188 --> 03:51.773
Drop Ripple Thrust Curve.

03:52.273 --> 03:53.650
Whirpool.

03:54.442 --> 03:57.111
I have never made
so many consecutive moves before.

03:57.862 --> 04:00.323
Both of my hands
feel like they are breaking.

04:01.866 --> 04:04.077
It's still not enough.

04:04.327 --> 04:08.122
I want you to suffer more.

04:15.463 --> 04:16.881
How many more times will it take?

04:17.799 --> 04:19.008
How many times will it take?

04:20.051 --> 04:21.261
I don't have time to think.

04:21.427 --> 04:23.054
I must focus on using my moves.

04:23.513 --> 04:25.223
Keep going!

04:30.687 --> 04:32.146
It's not enough.

04:32.647 --> 04:35.608
It's still not enough!

04:54.877 --> 04:56.004
Nezuko.

04:56.087 --> 04:57.213
Ms. Tamayo.

04:57.463 --> 04:58.506
Mr. Yushiro.

05:01.134 --> 05:03.219
I broke my rib and legs.

05:09.392 --> 05:10.935
This is bad.

05:11.602 --> 05:14.647
I'm so tired
that I couldn't hold my sword.

05:15.773 --> 05:18.151
I must go there quickly.

05:19.527 --> 05:20.987
The demon is still there.

05:24.699 --> 05:26.326
I'm coming over.

05:27.577 --> 05:28.786
I'm coming over soon.

05:29.329 --> 05:30.663
You guys must be safe.

05:31.122 --> 05:33.291
Please be safe.

05:45.386 --> 05:46.429
Useless fool.

05:46.512 --> 05:49.891
I can easily dodge your linear attacks.

05:50.058 --> 05:51.893
It's easy for me to locate you too.

05:54.645 --> 05:57.356
That makes two of us.

05:57.607 --> 06:00.109
No matter how you make yourself invisible,

06:00.276 --> 06:02.236
I can still see you!

06:10.536 --> 06:12.455
This is fun.

06:13.664 --> 06:14.665
You...

06:14.749 --> 06:17.418
Even if you can't die,
don't run out without thinking.

06:22.381 --> 06:23.800
What's wrong?

06:25.343 --> 06:26.761
What are you doing?

06:26.844 --> 06:27.845
The handball is coming!

06:36.229 --> 06:37.230
This girl.

06:38.856 --> 06:39.899
Lady Tamayo.

06:51.869 --> 06:54.789
You little brat!

06:55.081 --> 06:58.709
You can actually
kick my handballs back at me.

06:59.043 --> 07:00.461
How insolent of you!

07:20.148 --> 07:22.275
You little brat!

07:25.653 --> 07:26.821
How amazing.

07:27.280 --> 07:29.073
Lady Tamayo, this is...

07:29.323 --> 07:32.660
I only used a normal healing serum.

07:33.161 --> 07:34.579
It's a medicine for demons.

07:37.248 --> 07:39.333
It doesn't strengthen one's body.

07:39.959 --> 07:42.170
That is Nezuko's own strength.

07:43.129 --> 07:46.966
Without consuming human flesh,
she uses her own strength

07:48.759 --> 07:50.803
to become stronger quickly.

08:02.315 --> 08:04.609
But her opponent is powerful.

08:05.026 --> 08:07.904
If she uses her full power,
Nezuko won't be a match for her.

08:09.530 --> 08:12.742
I must do something.

08:16.412 --> 08:18.456
What an interesting girl.

08:18.623 --> 08:21.584
I'll treat you seriously from now on.

08:22.084 --> 08:24.837
I want to see how long you can last.

08:28.716 --> 08:30.927
Hey, Ms. Twelve Demon Moons.

08:31.260 --> 08:32.386
Don't get in the way.

08:32.470 --> 08:34.305
Move aside, traitor.

08:34.847 --> 08:37.016
Let me ask you a question.

08:37.892 --> 08:41.270
Do you know Kibutsuji's true nature?

08:42.647 --> 08:44.148
What do you mean?

08:44.440 --> 08:47.735
That man is merely a coward.

08:48.653 --> 08:50.821
He's always afraid of something.

08:51.322 --> 08:52.490
Stop it.

08:52.657 --> 08:54.033
Damn you, stop it!

08:54.784 --> 08:58.037
Do you know the reason
demons can't live together?

08:59.413 --> 09:02.041
Or the reason that demons
must slaughter each other?

09:03.376 --> 09:07.922
Kibutsuji does so to prevent demons
from banding together and attacking him.

09:09.048 --> 09:11.717
That's why he uses this method

09:12.510 --> 09:13.803
to control all of you.

09:14.637 --> 09:16.264
Shut up.

09:16.514 --> 09:18.099
Shut up!

09:18.266 --> 09:20.601
Our lord isn't as petty as you said.

09:22.311 --> 09:25.773
Lady Tamayo is using her spell.

09:27.567 --> 09:30.194
Our lord's power is unparalleled!

09:30.361 --> 09:32.029
He's stronger than everyone.

09:32.196 --> 09:33.656
Lord Kibutsuji is...

09:40.454 --> 09:42.957
You said his name.

09:45.459 --> 09:47.169
The curse will be activated.

09:50.464 --> 09:52.258
Mystical Fragrance of the White Day.

09:53.092 --> 09:55.136
It'll cause brain function to decrease

09:55.386 --> 09:59.056
so that the recipient can't lie
or keep their secrets.

10:00.141 --> 10:03.144
What a spectacular power, Lady Tamayo.

10:05.855 --> 10:07.690
Although you're pitiful,

10:08.733 --> 10:09.984
goodbye.

10:13.529 --> 10:16.198
Please forgive me.

10:16.574 --> 10:20.202
Please forgive me.

11:39.990 --> 11:41.617
Is she dead?

11:42.868 --> 11:44.495
She'll die soon.

11:46.372 --> 11:47.957
This is a curse.

11:48.874 --> 11:54.046
The Kibutsuji's cells remaining
in her body destroyed her.

11:57.216 --> 12:01.178
Generally, it's a waste of time
for demons to fight each other.

12:01.846 --> 12:03.097
It's meaningless

12:03.722 --> 12:06.142
because we can't kill each other.

12:07.351 --> 12:11.063
Only sunlight and the sword
of a demon slayer can do so.

12:14.358 --> 12:19.029
However, Kibutsuji can destroy
the cells of a demon.

12:25.035 --> 12:27.413
Don't inhale Lady Tamayo's spell.

12:27.746 --> 12:29.498
It can be harmful to humans.

12:29.582 --> 12:30.749
Get it?

12:31.834 --> 12:33.043
Tanjiro.

12:34.128 --> 12:37.715
She's not part of the Twelve Demon Moons.

12:39.425 --> 12:43.304
Twelve Demon Moons' eyeballs
are engraved with a number,

12:43.471 --> 12:44.847
but she doesn't have it.

12:46.056 --> 12:49.852
I'm afraid the other demon
isn't part of the Twelve Demon Moons too.

12:50.561 --> 12:51.812
They are too weak.

12:53.314 --> 12:54.440
Too weak?

12:54.773 --> 12:55.816
Are they considered weak?

12:56.233 --> 12:59.236
What Lady Tamayo said is right.

13:00.154 --> 13:03.240
But I can't believe such brainless demons

13:03.699 --> 13:06.452
dare injure the precious body
of Lady Tamayo.

13:06.702 --> 13:08.496
They totally deserve this.

13:13.000 --> 13:18.631
I hope this blood sample
can provide a lead in creating the cure.

13:20.883 --> 13:23.469
I'll check on Nezuko

13:24.053 --> 13:27.515
because I injected her with a serum
and she inhaled my spell.

13:28.682 --> 13:29.892
I'm sorry.

13:31.685 --> 13:33.812
Stay here and don't move.

13:33.896 --> 13:35.272
Do whatever you want.

13:35.397 --> 13:37.650
I don't want to leave Lady Tamayo.

13:37.816 --> 13:38.817
Not even a moment.

13:43.739 --> 13:46.325
DESTROY

13:46.408 --> 13:48.661
Handball.

13:50.663 --> 13:52.331
Handball.

13:52.831 --> 13:54.458
Handball.

14:07.721 --> 14:08.806
The handball is here.

14:10.266 --> 14:12.059
Let's play.

14:14.103 --> 14:15.980
Let's play.

14:18.065 --> 14:19.942
She's like a child,

14:21.026 --> 14:24.363
but she killed many people.

14:42.923 --> 14:45.217
Incited, she thought she was part
of Twelve Demon Moons.

14:45.593 --> 14:46.677
She was lied to.

14:47.011 --> 14:48.178
She was asked to fight.

14:48.888 --> 14:52.892
After that, she was murdered
by Kibutsuji's curse.

14:54.810 --> 14:56.061
She was beyond help.

14:58.188 --> 15:00.733
After her death, nothing is left of her.

15:04.570 --> 15:07.489
Is this their retribution
for killing others?

15:18.584 --> 15:19.793
Kibutsuji.

15:20.586 --> 15:24.506
That man actually did
this kind of thing to his worshippers.

15:25.633 --> 15:28.135
He's the true demon.

15:43.108 --> 15:44.193
Ms. Tamayo!

15:46.320 --> 15:47.488
Mr. Yushiro.

15:48.072 --> 15:49.573
Here. We're over here.

15:52.868 --> 15:54.912
It doesn't matter if you come or not.

15:55.079 --> 15:56.580
Come down if you want.

15:57.414 --> 15:58.540
Yushiro.

15:58.707 --> 15:59.875
I'm just kidding.

16:00.918 --> 16:03.128
Come down now, Mr. Tanjiro.

16:03.504 --> 16:04.630
Yes.

16:13.555 --> 16:14.765
Nezuko.

16:16.976 --> 16:18.811
Before the sun comes up,

16:18.978 --> 16:21.772
we moved to this basement
where we won't be exposed to sunlight.

16:23.816 --> 16:24.817
Nezuko?

16:30.864 --> 16:33.409
Stay away from Lady Tamayo!

16:33.492 --> 16:34.785
You're too disrespectful.

16:34.952 --> 16:36.453
Stop that, Yushiro.

16:37.204 --> 16:38.288
It's fine.

16:38.831 --> 16:39.832
Yes!

16:40.499 --> 16:42.292
Lady Tamayo is so gentle and considerate.

16:42.793 --> 16:44.336
She's so beautiful.

16:47.756 --> 16:49.675
Stop it.

16:50.175 --> 16:53.762
Ever since just now,
Nezuko has been in this state.

16:54.596 --> 16:56.223
Is she okay?

16:56.932 --> 16:58.142
Don't worry about her.

16:58.308 --> 16:59.393
She's fine.

17:01.103 --> 17:05.107
I think she takes you two
as our family members.

17:05.566 --> 17:06.608
Stop it.

17:06.859 --> 17:07.943
Family?

17:09.319 --> 17:14.491
But the hint planted inside Nezuko
was treating humans as family.

17:15.367 --> 17:17.536
We're demons though.

17:17.828 --> 17:19.246
Stop it.

17:19.830 --> 17:23.459
But Nezuko determined
that you two are humans,

17:24.001 --> 17:25.627
so she wants to protect you two.

17:29.339 --> 17:33.052
I don't like the fact
that Nezuko has the hint.

17:33.844 --> 17:36.638
Thank goodness, she still has
her own consciousness.

17:38.849 --> 17:40.267
I'm sorry!

17:40.350 --> 17:41.268
Nezuko!

17:41.351 --> 17:43.228
Nezuko! Let go now!

17:43.395 --> 17:44.605
It's disrespectful!

17:46.690 --> 17:47.649
Thank you,

17:49.109 --> 17:50.402
Nezuko.

17:50.944 --> 17:52.112
Thank you.

18:03.165 --> 18:06.502
Even if that's the case,
do you still want to live?

18:07.878 --> 18:12.132
Even though you're no longer human,
do you still want to live?

18:14.343 --> 18:17.971
At this rate, you'll lose your life
to this sickness.

18:18.847 --> 18:21.934
But not being human

18:22.351 --> 18:24.019
is very painful and sad.

18:25.938 --> 18:28.857
Even if that's the case,
do you still want to live?

18:38.534 --> 18:40.828
We need to leave this place.

18:42.746 --> 18:44.873
This place is too near to Kibutsuji.

18:45.374 --> 18:48.585
If we don't hide quickly,
we'll be in danger.

18:49.711 --> 18:52.673
Even if we try to hide,

18:53.173 --> 18:55.926
I'll be in contact
with many people as a doctor.

18:56.009 --> 18:58.053
Inevitably, they'll find out I'm a demon.

18:58.679 --> 19:01.557
Especially, the children and older people
who are more perceptive.

19:02.683 --> 19:03.934
Mr. Tanjiro.

19:04.309 --> 19:05.310
Yes.

19:05.853 --> 19:10.023
Leave Nezuko in our care.

19:13.235 --> 19:15.779
Although I can't guarantee her safety,

19:16.405 --> 19:19.700
it's safer than you bringing her
into fights.

19:23.954 --> 19:25.289
Maybe she's right.

19:26.039 --> 19:30.002
Indeed, entrusting them
with Nezuko will be great for her.

19:45.767 --> 19:46.894
Ms. Tamayo.

19:47.060 --> 19:48.812
Thank you for your kind offer.

19:50.105 --> 19:53.025
But we want to be together.

19:53.984 --> 19:55.611
We'll never part ways.

19:58.238 --> 19:59.990
We won't part ways again.

20:02.951 --> 20:04.161
I understand.

20:04.745 --> 20:07.331
I wish you all the best
in your future battles.

20:07.706 --> 20:08.790
See you.

20:09.499 --> 20:11.960
We'll leave after removing all the traces.

20:12.544 --> 20:14.463
You two better leave now.

20:15.172 --> 20:16.131
Yes.

20:16.298 --> 20:19.343
Well, please take care,
Ms. Tamayo and Mr. Yushiro.

20:21.470 --> 20:22.804
Let's go, Nezuko.

20:25.974 --> 20:27.643
You don't have to run.

20:27.726 --> 20:28.644
Tanjiro!

20:32.564 --> 20:35.567
Your sister is beautiful.

20:43.700 --> 20:45.577
Southeast!

20:45.661 --> 20:48.413
Southeast!

20:48.497 --> 20:52.167
Your next destination
is to your southeast.

20:52.251 --> 20:53.543
I know.

20:53.627 --> 20:56.421
-I know, so can you please keep quiet?
-Southeast!

20:56.505 --> 20:57.631
Please.

20:57.714 --> 20:59.549
I know that, so please.

20:59.633 --> 21:00.801
Please!

21:03.428 --> 21:05.264
Please.

21:05.347 --> 21:07.307
Will you marry me?

21:07.391 --> 21:09.893
I don't know when I'll die!

21:10.143 --> 21:12.729
So I hope you'll marry me.

21:12.813 --> 21:15.691
Please!

21:15.774 --> 21:19.695
What's wrong with that guy?

22:53.163 --> 22:55.707
"Southeast!"

22:55.791 --> 22:58.627
I just finished a tough fight.
When can I catch a break?

22:59.252 --> 23:00.504
What? Do I sound like it?

23:00.587 --> 23:02.172
I didn't imitate it deliberately.

23:03.340 --> 23:06.009
Here's a little gossip
from the Taisho era.

23:06.426 --> 23:09.513
Every Demon Slayer Corps'
Kasugai Crow has its own name.

23:09.596 --> 23:13.225
I heard my Kasugai Crow's name
is Tennoji Matsuemon.

23:13.934 --> 23:14.976
Okay, one last time.

23:15.060 --> 23:18.230
"This is your first mission
as a demon slayer!"

23:18.313 --> 23:21.608
I mean I've been fighting continuously
since I began my first mission.

23:22.150 --> 23:24.569
Next, episode 11, "Tsuzumi Mansion."

23:24.653 --> 23:27.030
Why doesn't the Demon Slayer Corps
let us rest?

23:27.572 --> 23:28.615
TO BE CONTINUED

23:28.698 --> 23:29.658
Subtitle translation by Michelle Chai
